==Battleground==
*1 [[Snache]] spawns.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nyalladin (Enemy)|Nyalladin]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**20 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The 3 Leboin's at the beginning of the stage will allow you to max out your worker cat and later on the Crocos and the Ginger Snaches will give you a constant flow of money. Nyalladin's wave attacks are the main threat of this stage, since they prevent [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and other slow-moving nukers from landing a hit. Because of this, use units that either outrange it or have enough health to tank a hit and deal chip damage to Nyalladin.

